      },
      "text": "Two fundamental approaches: **casting** (pour molten metal into a mold) and **fabrication** (build from sheet, wire, and tube by cutting, forming, and joining). Everything else — filigree, granulation, enameling — is a surface treatment or decorative variation on these two foundations."
