      "text": "SHAPING METHODS                     JOINING METHODS\n===============                     ===============\n                                     Soldering (hard solder — filler metal)\nCASTING             FABRICATION      Fusing (no solder — surface diffusion)\n=======             ===========      Riveting (mechanical)\n                                     Tabs and bezels (mechanical fold)\nLost wax (cire     Sheet metal\nperdue):           working:          SURFACE DECORATION\n - Traditional      - Rolling mill   ==================\n - Modern centri-   - Sawing         Engraving (incised lines)\n   fugal/vacuum     - Filing         Chasing/repoussé (hammered relief)\n - Rubber mold      - Forming        Granulation (fused spheres)\n   production                        Filigree (wire openwork)\n                   Wire work:        Enameling (fused glass)\nSand casting        - Drawing        Texturing (hammers, rollers)\nCuttlebone          - Twisting       Patina / oxidation\ncentrifugal         - Winding        Plating (electrochemical)\ncasting\n```"
